# The spans of the consumer hook this fixture's arms exercise: the queue, key pass and flush it asserts on, the delete-only
# exit before them, the shell-syntax glob its last step runs, and the refusal exit its trailer reads. A whole-program row
# is refused by scripts/invalidation-guard.sh --ratchet, so the hook is declared by span.
core/git-hooks/pre-push PRESUITE_UNITS
core/git-hooks/pre-push PUSH_DELETE
core/git-hooks/pre-push SYNTAX_GLOB
core/git-hooks/pre-push FIXTURE_EXIT
